@askhl Would you mind if I set %3.27.1 to this MR?

This is in the end a small (but important to make `iread_xyz` work with a for loop) bug-fix to `ixyzchunks`, which may not take long time for review (other parts are just annotations).
I plan to have a follow-up to refactor `read_lammps_dump_text` with `ImageIterator`, and for that it would be helpful to first clean up the related code, which is partly done in the present MR.
